DESCRIPTION:Four top comedians compete to see who is the champion pub games
  and beermat flipper 2026! Sikisa\, Stuart Laws and Matt Sandstorm host com
 edy's premier sporting event\, with four guest comedians competing to take 
 home the prestigious trophy. Previous winners include David O'Doherty and P
 hil Wang\, losers include Dara O Briain and Rosie Jones – who will triump
 h this time? Expect trick shots\, live betting odds\, trash talk and a nigh
 t to remember. As featured on TalkSport\, BBC Radio 4 and BBC Radio 5 Live.
